<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>CTF - Invalid Token</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #1a1a1a; color: #fff; margin: 0; padding: 50px; text-align: center; }
        .error-box { background: #2d2d2d; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #ff4444; max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .retry-btn { background: #00ff00; color: #000; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin: 10px 5px; }
        .retry-btn:hover { background: #00cc00; }
        .home-btn { background: #666; color: #fff; }
        .home-btn:hover { background: #777; }
        h1 { color: #ff4444; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-box">
        <h1>❌ Invalid Token</h1>
        <p>The participant token you entered is not valid. Please check your token and try again.</p>
        <a href="/participant" class="retry-btn">Enter Token Again</a>
        <a href="/" class="retry-btn home-btn">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>